r values**, mixed stdio) | **byte-identical**, 1938 bytes |\n| `git status c_src` | clean — `c_src/` untouched |\n\nBoth test binaries were the *same* `main.c` linked against the C `.so` and the Rust `.so` respectively, so the comparison isolates library behavior."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":206,"cache_read_input_tokens":26366,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":206,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7211b132-244b-49dd-b26b-c1bbc742adb2","uuid":"b2352e42-433b-4c7b-bf27-245bb692a614","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:35:35.802Z"}
